---@field ttl? string Desired lifetime duration of the access token. This value must be at most 24 hours. If a value is not specified, the token's lifetime will be set to a default value of 1 hour.
---@field expireTime? string Desired expiration time of the access token. This value must be at most 24 hours in the future. If a value is not specified, the token's expiration time will be set to a default value of 1 hour in the future.
