---@field disableLocalhostReplacement? boolean Optional. By default, the workstations service replaces references to localhost, 127.0.0.1, and 0.0.0.0 with the workstation's hostname in http responses from the workstation so that applications under development run properly on the workstation. This may intefere with some applications, and so this option allows that behavior to be disabled.
